lking  about you can click on any charity right  in your neighborhood  donate to any non-profit and it will all  count toward  that big super bowl of karen goldeneyes  yeah david so we're going to be raising  money for food banks during our new  year's eve special thursday night  all the money donated will stay right  here in las vegas  so that show kicking off at nine o'clock  running through 12  35 and our team will take you through  every time zone  starting in new york and ending of  course here in las vegas we will be live  along the las vegas strip in downtown  las vegas  with live performances and everyone will  be social distancing  doing cobid screenings and following all  the guidelines to stay safe
 

